# Firstbid — Docker environment
#
# The dashboard service needs nothing: it reads the public Somnia Shannon
# testnet indexer, RPC and price-feed endpoints, which are hardcoded in
# core/internal/venue (no credentials required).
#
# This variable only matters if you start the optional `engine` service
# with `-live` added to its command in docker-compose.yml. Leave it unset to
# run the engine in DRY RUN (default): it prices windows and logs the quotes
# it would place, and signs nothing.
#
# Shannon testnet ONLY. Throwaway key. Never put a mainnet/real-value key here.
FIRSTBID_PRIVATE_KEY=0x_your_throwaway_testnet_private_key
